registered_metrics.definition:
The Vacancies value produced by apps.frontend.views.hr_views._metric; the preserved server display expression is `Vacancy.objects.filter(
                    status__in=["Approved", "Open", "Screening"]
                ).count()`.

The Average score value produced by apps.frontend.views.hr_views._metric; the preserved server display expression is `f"{(sum(r.score for r in reviews) / reviews.count()):.0f}%"
                if reviews.count()
                else "0%"`.

registered_metrics.numerator:
f"{(sum(r.score for r in reviews) / reviews.count()):.0f}%"
                if reviews.count()
                else "0%"

registered_metrics.definition:
The Awaiting CCEO Send value produced by apps.fund_requests.pl_approval_service.get_pl_fund_approvals; the preserved server display expression is `_ugx(
                sum(
                    p["request_total"] or p["total"] for p in pending_send
                )
            )`.

registered_metrics.numerator:
_ugx(
                sum(
                    p["request_total"] or p["total"] for p in pending_send
                )
            )
